    family-names: Erim
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/EfeErim/aeromaintain-ai"
url: "https://aeromaintain-ai-demo.streamlit.app/"
abstract: >-
  Remaining-useful-life prediction for turbofan engines on NASA's simulated C-MAPSS
  and N-CMAPSS benchmarks, with prediction intervals and maintenance alarms. Each test
  set is opened once, after the model, intervals and thresholds are hashed into a
  committed lock.
keywords:
  - predictive maintenance
  - remaining useful life
  - NASA C-MAPSS
  - conformal prediction
